{
  "slug": "gambit",
  "name": "Gambit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Gambit brings structured PM workflows into Claude Code. Skills cover every phase of the product lifecycle: synthesizing user research, writing feature requests with auto-generated acceptance criteria, generating strategy documents, building OKRs and roadmaps, running sprint reviews, drafting release notes and stakeholder updates, and producing engineering handoff briefs.\n\nEach skill silently scans your project for existing context — strategy docs, OKRs, prior research output — before asking questions, so output builds on what's already there rather than starting from scratch.\n\nChained agents sequence skills into end-to-end workflows with confirmation steps between stages.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **13 skills** and **4 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (13): `build-user-persona` (Build evidence-backed user personas from research inputs), `competitive-analysis` (Structure a competitive landscape analysis — player profiles, capability comparison matrix, whitespace opportunities, and strategic implications), `prioritize` (Score and rank a list of features or initiatives using RICE by default), `sprint-review` (Generate a professional sprint review report for stakeholders — PMs, leadership, and cross-functional teams), `synthesize-user-research` (Synthesize raw user research (interview notes, survey results, support tickets, NPS verbatims) into structured insights: themes, pain points,…), `verify-acceptance-criteria` (Verify acceptance criteria quality and identify gaps), `write-feature-request` (Guided Feature Request (FR) authoring), `write-okrs` (Generate well-structured OKRs from a product strategy), and 5 more\n- **Agents** (4): `discovery-to-fr` (End-to-end research-to-spec workflow), `fr-to-ready` (Feature-request-to-dev-ready workflow), `sprint-to-stakeholders` (Full sprint-to-communications workflow), `strategy-to-roadmap` (Full strategy-to-execution workflow)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install gambit@claude-community` from `felipecabargas/gambit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
